The Universe is probably NOT a simulation.  There are many lines of evidence that lend weight to this conclusion.

&amp;#x200B;

For example, [here](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-018-05739-8) is a paper that argues that quantum theory cannot be used to describe itself in a consistent manner.  One possible implication of this is that a quantum computer could not be used to simulate quantum events.
